# State files

- `CURRENT.md` must describe exactly one task: ID, Spec Sec, files, done-when.
- After completing a task, check the matching `PROGRESS.md` line and replace `CURRENT.md` with the next unchecked item.
- Never expand CURRENT with full module specs — link `Spec: Sec N` only.
